{
  "_note": "生成器 tools/infosource/gen_secfilings.py。xJob/new.xjob 的取数段:只取数,不写状态。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "insRaw",
        "value": "${ins}"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "insIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${insRaw},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "qow",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${insIn},1),include,exclude)]"
      },
      "_note": "默认只看公司自己的文件;打开「也提醒内部人交易」时看全部(含 Form 4)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "IMPS0",
        "value": "~8-K~8-K/A~10-Q~10-K~10-Q/A~10-K/A~6-K~20-F~40-F~"
      },
      "_note": "会提醒的类型名单(8-K / 10-Q / 10-K 及更正,外国公司 6-K / 20-F / 40-F)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "IMPS",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${insIn},1),connect::(${IMPS0},4~),${IMPS0})]"
      },
      "_note": "ins=1 时名单里再加 Form 4。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lst",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "sec_list",
        "default": []
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b0",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnt",
        "value": "$[length::(${lst})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "T",
        "value": {
          "t0": "${lst[0].t}",
          "t1": "${lst[1].t}",
          "t2": "${lst[2].t}",
          "t3": "${lst[3].t}",
          "t4": "${lst[4].t}",
          "t5": "${lst[5].t}",
          "t6": "${lst[6].t}",
          "t7": "${lst[7].t}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${T.t0}),0),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "request",
          "id": "r0",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=${T.t0}&type=&dateb=&owner=${qow}&count=40&output=atom",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable support@numable.app",
              "Accept": "application/atom+xml"
            },
            "timeout": "12000"
          },
          "_note": "formatType:string —— Atom XML 不经任何 XML 解析器,用 split 切(xmlParse 四端是四个引擎,对带默认 xmlns 的 Atom 结果互相矛盾;memory actionflow-df-pitfalls §xmlparse)。UA 是 SEC 要求的如实身份,不是伪装(见生成器头注)。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
